# Codebase-First Workflow

`AGENTS.md` is the canonical repository policy, and root `CLAUDE.md` imports it at
session start. Resolve any conflict in favor of `AGENTS.md`.

Before code edits, provide the required pre-edit report:
- existing pattern matched,
- exact blast radius,
- scope-expanding decisions for confirmation.

Preserve one obvious implementation path. Reuse existing helpers, folders, types,
schemas, services, stores, hooks, API contracts, and test patterns before creating
anything new. Do not add backwards compatibility, aliases, duplicate helpers,
fallback branches, ignored fields, or dead code. Delete replaced paths in the same
change.
